<title>USA: Rykoff-Sexton names McAnally as CFO.</title>
<headline>Rykoff-Sexton names McAnally as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rykoff-Sexton Inc said Thursday it had named David McAnally as senior vice president and chief financial officer, effective January 1.</p>
<p>McAnally succeeds Richard Martin, who will become senior vice president-corporate development.</p>
<p>The changes follow the company's acquisition of US Foodservice Inc earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
